name: Document Responder Mandate
type: Mandate/Mandate
description: >
  Mandate authorizing the actor bound to authorizedActorChannel to respond to
  covered requests emitted by sessions of authorizedInitialDocument. The
  concrete request shape and additional conditions are defined through the
  inherited validation fields.

authorizedInitialDocument:
  schema:
    required: true
  description: Initial document whose sessions may emit covered requests.
